WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.950
There are so many new beauty releases

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.090
happening all the time,

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:05.280
so we gathered some of
the most-hyped products

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.480
to test for ourselves.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.180
I'm a big fan of the Made
by Mitchell Blurshes.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.100
I tried a purple blush from them before,

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.710
and I loved it, and they just came out

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.240
with a lavender shade, so I had to try it.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.060
Applying it on top of
my makeup was a mistake,

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.770
because it's a pastel.

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:22.200
It was basically like
I applied a white blush

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.550
over my bronzer.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.560
Plus, it actually made
my foundation patchy,

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:28.560
which is an issue that I've
never had with this formula.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.780
I think I might've just overblended.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.820
Trying it out on bare
skin wasn't any better.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.460
It just leaves this
very gray-looking cast.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.573
I looked like the Corpse Bride.

00:00:37.573 --> 00:00:38.912
I think I'm better off using this

00:00:38.912 --> 00:00:41.190
as an eyeliner and eye-shadow base.

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:44.007
Clinique has finally come
out with a lip-gloss version

00:00:44.007 --> 00:00:46.290
of its iconic Black Honey lipstick.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.232
This color is definitely identical

00:00:48.232 --> 00:00:50.890
to the lipstick version, just glossy.

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:52.590
Here's what they look like side by side.

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:55.170
I liked it a little more
once I dabbed some off.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:57.420
This color is just really flattering.

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.553
I have to say, though, this gloss formula

00:00:59.553 --> 00:01:01.269
is not my favorite.

00:01:01.269 --> 00:01:03.690
I think they were going
for a cushiony feel,

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:06.180
but it's just kind of sticky and thick.

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:08.730
Looks great, but it doesn't feel so great.

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.460
ELF released this Halo Glow Liquid Filter,

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:13.230
and the world stopped.

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:14.670
Could this actually be a dupe

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:17.543
for the Charlotte Tilbury
Flawless Filter? Let's see.

00:01:17.543 --> 00:01:20.040
On this side of my face I
applied Flawless Filter.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.470
It's gorgeous. It's glowy. It's perfect.

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:25.320
Now, on this side, I
applied the ELF Halo Glow.

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:26.940
Look at them side by side.

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:28.620
They are almost identical.

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:31.590
I would say that the ELF one
has a hint more coverage,

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:32.850
but it still gives that same

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:34.572
your-skin-but-better effect.

00:01:34.572 --> 00:01:37.680
And the Charlotte Tilbury
one is slightly more glowy.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:38.700
Slightly.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.800
I say save yourself the extra 30 bucks

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.880
and get the ELF one.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.996
Side note: Look at the
size of this doe foot.

00:01:43.996 --> 00:01:45.004
It's huge!

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.010
You guys know I adore Rare Beauty.

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:48.720
I was so excited when they dropped

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:51.690
these Kind Words matte
lipsticks and lip liners.

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:53.070
I had to get the color Gifted,

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:55.500
because Selena said that
that was her favorite.

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.150
The lip liner is supersmooth.

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.116
Even though it's matte,

00:01:58.116 --> 00:02:00.007
it doesn't drag or pull on the lips.

00:02:00.007 --> 00:02:01.800
Plus, it's a twist-up, which I love.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.020
The lipstick is so creamy and pigmented.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.300
You could probably put
this on in one swipe.

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.175
It's definitely one of
the most comfortable

00:02:08.175 --> 00:02:09.930
matte lipsticks I've ever tried.

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:12.180
Scrandie Beauty is a
brand I found on TikTok.

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:15.420
I kept seeing videos of its
Spicy Sauce lip plumper,

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:16.908
and I really wanted to test it out,

00:02:16.908 --> 00:02:19.200
since I haven't had much
luck with lip plumpers.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.490
I applied it to half my lips,

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:22.650
so we could see if it
actually does anything.

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:24.990
So, you apply it slightly
above your lip line,

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:27.450
and it starts to feel a little spicy,

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:29.940
then it starts to feel tingly and spicy,

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.470
and then at the three-minute mark,

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:34.440
you also start to feel
a warming sensation.

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:35.968
I love lip plumpers,

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:38.730
so I don't mind the roller
coaster this takes you on.

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:40.500
It feels kind of good to me.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.033
I definitely notice plumping,

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:43.774
especially with my top lip.

00:02:43.774 --> 00:02:45.390
I really like this lip plumper,

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:46.620
and I also like that it's clear,

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:48.520
so you can wear it on top of anything.

